  "Reboot or shut down the TrueNAS system.\n\n  • Reboot   – restart the system\n  • Shutdown – power off the system\n\nYou will be prompted for a reason and confirmation\nbefore any action is taken.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Genstart eller luk TrueNAS-systemet ned.\n\n  • Genstart – genstart systemet\n  • Shutdown – sluk for systemet\n\nDu vil blive bedt om en årsag og bekræftelse\nfør der træffes nogen handling."
  },
  "Reboot the TrueNAS system.\n\nYou will be prompted to enter a reason for the reboot\nbefore the system restarts.\n\nAll active sessions and shares will be interrupted.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
